BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:161791@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260801T082530Z
DTSTART:20260907T040000Z
DTEND:20260908T035900Z
SUMMARY:Labor Day
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England observes this holiday:\n\n\n	Participant Support and most other departments are not staffed\n	Settlements will not be released and initial settlement metering deadlines will not fall on this day\n	The Credit department is closed\, along with Federal Reserve and BlackRock\n\n\nFor after-hours business emergencies\, contact Participant Support at (877) 226-4814 (pager). See Contact the ISO for other options.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161791
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161791
END:VEVENT
